Subject: [PATCH 2/7] regions: analytic boundary regions
 (ParticleRegion.representation, buildRegion(representation=): not sampled, no
 ghost layer; initializer builds the analytic RigidBody); dambreak
 wallRepresentation='analytic' for the plain tank

---
